{"id":"SEC-002","category":"security","criterion":"input_validation","severity":"HIGH","score":2,"file":"head/evals/harness/ablation-grade.sh","line":1080,"code_snippet":"res = run_suite(final, t.test_command, t.static_cases)\ng[\"hidden_tests\"] = summary(res)","reasoning_trace":"test_command is a directory sweep (tests/) per the seeders (:397, :465) and the fixtures; the result is reported whole as hidden_tests. AG-1 (ablation-grade.bats:243) expects 7/7 for a hidden file of 5 cases because tests/test_existing.py is swept in; TASK.md tells the agent to add a test of its own (seed_tasks.py:432). Confirmed review Changes Required §2 and dissent DISS-C-001.","finding":"hidden_tests counts visible and agent-added tests; hidden_test_pass_rate is agent-inflatable.","remediation":"Keep only order/bad entries whose path is an overlay destination (excluding structural); total = max(len(kept), static_cases); update AG-1 to 5/5.","confidence":"high","references":["https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/807.html"]}
